使用Jackson库：
```
import com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper;
import com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat.yaml.YAMLFactory;

public class YamlJacksonExample {

    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        CrawlerConfig configObject = new CrawlerConfig("test", 250, 50);
        ObjectMapper mapper = new ObjectMapper(new YAMLFactory());
        String yamlString = mapper.writeValueAsString(configObject);
        System.out.println("Yaml String: ");
        System.out.println(yamlString);
    }

    public static class CrawlerConfig {
        private String name;
        private int sheinAmount;
        private int amazonAmount;

        public CrawlerConfig(String name, int sheinAmount, int amazonAmount) {
            this.name = name;
            this.sheinAmount = sheinAmount;
            this.amazonAmount = amazonAmount;
        }

        public String getName() {
            return name;
        }

        public void setName(String name) {
            this.name = name;
        }

        public int getSheinAmount() {
            return sheinAmount;
        }

        public void setSheinAmount(int sheinAmount) {
            this.sheinAmount = sheinAmount;
        }

        public int getAmazonAmount() {
            return amazonAmount;
        }

        public void setAmazonAmount(int amazonAmount) {
            this.amazonAmount = amazonAmount;
        }
    }
}
```

在此示例中，我们首先定义一个表示配置的Java类（CrawlerConfig），它具有相应的属性。然后，我们使用Jackson库的ObjectMapper将Java对象转化为Yaml格式的字符串。

使用SnakeYAML库：
```
import org.yaml.snakeyaml.Yaml;
import org.yaml.snakeyaml.DumperOptions;
import org.yaml.snakeyaml.DumperOptions.FlowStyle;

public class YamlSnakeExample {

    public static void main(String[] args) throws Exception {
        CrawlerConfig configObject = new CrawlerConfig("test", 250, 50);
        DumperOptions options = new DumperOptions();
        options.setDefaultFlowStyle(FlowStyle.BLOCK);
        Yaml yaml = new Yaml(options);
        String yamlString = yaml.dumpAsMap(configObject);
        System.out.println("Yaml String: ");
        System.out.println(yamlString);
    }

    public static class CrawlerConfig {
        private String name;
        private int sheinAmount;
        private int amazonAmount;

        public CrawlerConfig(String name, int sheinAmount, int amazonAmount) {
            this.name = name;
            this.sheinAmount = sheinAmount;
            this.amazonAmount = amazonAmount;
        }

        public String getName() {
            return name;
        }

        public void setName(String name) {
            this.name = name;
        }

        public int getSheinAmount() {
            return sheinAmount;
        }

        public void setSheinAmount(int sheinAmount) {
            this.sheinAmount = sheinAmount;
        }

        public int getAmazonAmount() {
            return amazonAmount;
        }

        public void setAmazonAmount(int amazonAmount) {
            this.amazonAmount = amazonAmount;
        }
    }
}
```

在此示例中，我们同样使用CrawlerConfig类，然后使用SnakeYAML库的dumpAsMap方法将Java对象转化为Yaml格式的字符串。

无论使用哪种库，最终将Java对象转化为Yaml格式的字符串都非常简单。然后，您可以使用该字符串将配置发布到Nacos或任何其他支持Yaml格式的配置中心。
